<p>When you crit you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">24%, 34%, 41%, 45%, 50%</acronym> chance to reduce by 1 the remaining cooldown of one of your inscriptions and of any saturations effects.</p><p>This effect can only happen once per turn.</p>